    "# Tahap 3: Data Integration & Redundancy Analysis\n",
    "**Silabus:** Jiawei Han - Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques, Ch. 3 (Data Integration)  \n",
    "**DataFrame Target:** `df_clean` (Data Hasil Preprocessing Step 2)  \n",
    "**Fokus:**  \n",
    "1. **Analisis Redundansi Nominal**: Uji Chi-Square ($\\chi^2$), Tabel Kontingensi Observasi & Ekspektasi, Heatmap, dan Evaluasi Semantik Bisnis.  \n",
    "2. **Analisis Redundansi Numerik**: Matriks Kovariansi & Korelasi Pearson ($r$), Heatmap Korelasi, dan Evaluasi Semantik Bisnis berdasarkan Prinsip Jiawei Han."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import scipy.stats as stats\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "from IPython.display import display, Markdown\n",
    "\n",
    "# 0. Memuat & Menyiapkan df_clean (Sesuai Step 2 Preprocessing)\n",
    "csv_file = \"hotel_booking_data.csv\"\n",
    "df_raw = pd.read_csv(csv_file)\n",
    "\n",
    "cols_to_drop = ['name', 'email', 'phone-number', 'credit_card', 'reservation_status', 'reservation_status_date']\n",
    "df_clean = df_raw.drop(columns=[c for c in cols_to_drop if c in df_raw.columns]).drop_duplicates()\n",
    "\n",
    "adr_anom = (df_clean['adr'] < 0) | (df_clean['adr'] > 1000)\n",
    "total_guests = df_clean['adults'] + df_clean['children'].fillna(0) + df_clean['babies'].fillna(0)\n",
    "df_clean = df_clean[~adr_anom & (total_guests > 0)].copy()\n",
    "\n",
    "df_clean['children'] = df_clean['children'].fillna(0).astype(int)\n",
    "df_clean['country'] = df_clean['country'].fillna('Unknown')\n",
    "df_clean['agent'] = df_clean['agent'].fillna(0)\n",
    "df_clean['company'] = df_clean['company'].fillna(0)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"Data Clean Siap Dianalisis: {df_clean.shape[0]:,} baris, {df_clean.shape[1]} kolom\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# =========================================================\n",
    "# 1. ANALISIS REDUNDANSI DATA NOMINAL (CHI-SQUARE TEST / χ²)\n",
    "# =========================================================\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 80)\n",
    "print(\"1. CHI-SQUARE TEST: reserved_room_type VS assigned_room_type\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 80)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Tabel Kontingensi Observasi (Observed)\n",
    "obs_contingency = pd.crosstab(df_clean['reserved_room_type'], df_clean['assigned_room_type'])\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Tabel Kontingensi Frekuensi Observasi (Observed) ---\")\n",
    "display(obs_contingency)\n",
    "\n",
    "# Hitung Chi-Square, p-value, df, dan Expected Values\n",
    "chi2_stat, p_val, dof, expected_vals = stats.chi2_contingency(obs_contingency)\n",
    "expected_df = pd.DataFrame(expected_vals, index=obs_contingency.index, columns=obs_contingency.columns)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Tabel Frekuensi Ekspektasi (Expected Values e_ij) ---\")\n",
    "display(expected_df.round(2))\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"\\n▶ Statistik Chi-Square (χ²) : {chi2_stat:,.4f}\")\n",
    "print(f\"▶ p-value                   : {p_val:.4e}\")\n",
    "print(f\"▶ Derajat Kebebasan (df)     : {dof}  [Rumus: (r - 1) * (c - 1) = ({obs_contingency.shape[0]} - 1) * ({obs_contingency.shape[1]} - 1)]\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Heatmap Tabel Kontingensi\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(obs_contingency, annot=True, fmt='d', cmap='YlGnBu', cbar=True)\n",
    "plt.title(\"Heatmap Tabel Kontingensi: Reserved vs Assigned Room Type\", fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.xlabel(\"Assigned Room Type\")\n",
    "plt.ylabel(\"Reserved Room Type\")\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Evaluasi Semantik Bisnis: Analisis Redundansi Nominal ($\\chi^2$ Test)\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Hasil Uji Hipotesis & Signifikansi Statistik**:\n",
    "   - **Statistik $\\chi^2$**: $387,036.71$\n",
    "   - **$p\\text{-value}$**: $0.0000$ ($p < 0.05$)\n",
    "   - **Derajat Kebebasan ($df$)**: $80$ (berasal dari $(9 - 1) \\times (11 - 1)$)\n",
    "   - **Kesimpulan Uji**: Hipotesis nol ($H_0$) ditolak secara signifikan. Atribut `reserved_room_type` dan `assigned_room_type` memiliki **asosiasi dependen yang sangat kuat** secara statistik.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Mengapa `assigned_room_type` TIDAK BOLEH Dihapus? (Fenomena Bisnis Upgrade/Downgrade)**:\
    "   - Meskipun kedua variabel berasosiasi kuat secara statistik, secara **semantik bisnis keduanya TIDAK redundan**.\n",
    "   - **`reserved_room_type`** menunjukkan tipe kamar yang *dipesan* tamu di awal.\n",
    "   - **`assigned_room_type`** menunjukkan tipe kamar yang *aktual diberikan* oleh pihak hotel saat check-in.\n",
    "   - Perbedaan antara kedua kolom ini mencerminkan fenomena bisnis **room mismatch (upgrade / downgrade kamar)**. Apabila tamu mendapatkan tipe kamar yang berbeda (terutama downgrade karena keterbatasan stok kamar), hal ini menjadi pemicu utama ketidakpuasan tamu dan meningkatkan risiko pembatalan (`is_canceled`).\n",
    "   - **Rekomendasi Preprocessing**: Kedua atribut **wajib dipertahankan** karena perbandingannya memberikan fitur turunan baru yang sangat krusial untuk pemodelan ML (misal fitur boolean `is_room_upgraded` atau `room_mismatch`)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# =========================================================\n",
    "# 2. ANALISIS REDUNDANSI DATA NUMERIK (COVARIANCE & PEARSON CORRELATION)\n",
    "# =========================================================\n",
    "print(\"\\n\" + \"=\" * 80)\n",
    "print(\"2. KOVARIANSI & KORELASI PEARSON ATRIBUT NUMERIK\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 80)\n",
    "\n",
    "num_cols = [\n",
    "    'lead_time', 'stays_in_weekend_nights', 'stays_in_week_nights',\n",
    "    'adults', 'children', 'booking_changes', 'adr', 'total_of_special_requests'\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Matriks Kovariansi\n",
    "cov_matrix = df_clean[num_cols].cov()\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Matriks Kovariansi (Covariance Matrix) ---\")\n",
    "display(cov_matrix.round(4))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Matriks Korelasi Pearson\n",
    "corr_matrix = df_clean[num_cols].corr()\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Matriks Korelasi Pearson (r) ---\")\n",
    "display(corr_matrix.round(4))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Heatmap Korelasi Pearson\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(9, 7))\n",
    "sns.heatmap(corr_matrix, annot=True, fmt='.3f', cmap='coolwarm', vmin=-1, vmax=1, linewidths=0.5)\n",
    "plt.title(\"Heatmap Matriks Korelasi Pearson Atribut Numerik\", fontsize=13, fontweight='bold')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()\n",
    "\n",
    "# Pasangan fitur dengan korelasi tertinggi\n",
    "corr_unstacked = corr_matrix.unstack()\n",
    "top_corrs = corr_unstacked[corr_unstacked < 1.0].sort_values(ascending=False).drop_duplicates()\n",
    "print(\"\\n--- Pasangan Fitur Numerik dengan Korelasi Tertinggi ---\")\n",
    "display(top_corrs.head(5))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Evaluasi Semantik Bisnis: Analisis Redundansi Numerik (Kovariansi & Korelasi Pearson)\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Temuan Korelasi Tertinggi**:\n",
    "   - Pasangan fitur numerik dengan korelasi tertinggi adalah **`stays_in_weekend_nights`** dan **`stays_in_week_nights`** dengan nilai korelasi Pearson **$r \\approx 0.550$**.\n",
    "   - Pasangan lain: `adr` vs `children` ($r \\approx 0.345$), `lead_time` vs `stays_in_week_nights` ($r \\approx 0.314$), dan `adr` vs `adults` ($r \\approx 0.256$).\n",
    "\n",
    "2. **Rujukan Prinsip Jiawei Han (Kapan Atribut Dianggap Redundan?)**:\n",
    "   - Berdasarkan buku *Data Mining: Concepts and Techniques* oleh Jiawei Han (Ch. 3 Data Integration), redundansi korelasi terjadi apabila dua atribut numerik memiliki korelasi yang sangat kuat mendekati sempurna (umumnya $|r| \\ge 0.85$ atau $0.90$), seperti pada contoh pergerakan *Stock A* dan *Stock B* ($r = 0.94$). Pada kondisi $r = 0.94$, salah satu atribut dapat dihilangkan karena tidak memberikan variansi informasi baru.\n",
    "   - Pada dataset `hotel_booking_data.csv`, nilai korelasi tertinggi hanya $r = 0.550$, yang tergolong dalam **korelasi sedang** ($r < 0.70$) dan berada jauh di bawah batas redundansi statistik ($|r| \\ge 0.85$).\n",
    "\n",
    "3. **Justifikasi Pertahanan Atribut (Mengapa Tidak Ada Atribut Numerik yang Dihapus?)**:\n",
    "   - **`stays_in_weekend_nights` vs `stays_in_week_nights`**: Meskipun keduanya berkorelasi positif ($r = 0.550$), secara bisnis keduanya mewakili segmen durasi menginap yang berbeda:\n",
    "     - *Week nights* mendominasi perilaku reservasi tamu bisnis (*business travelers*).\n",
    "     - *Weekend nights* mendominasi perilaku wisatawan liburan (*family/leisure travelers*).\n",
    "   - Menghapus salah satu atribut akan menghilangkan pola variasi durasi menginap yang krusial bagi prediksi pembatalan.\n",
    "   - **Kesimpulan Preprocessing**: Seluruh 8 atribut numerik **dipertahankan sepenuhnya** dan tidak ada yang dieliminasi karena tidak terbukti memiliki redundansi informasi yang sia-sia."
   ]
